## ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## .gitignore for CmCSP – Blazor Server / ASP.NET Core 10
## ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets & environment-specific config ─────────────────────────────────────
# appsettings.Development.json is tracked in git because it contains only
# non-secret, dev-specific settings (log levels, short cache TTL, etc.).
# Real secrets (TenantId, ClientId, ClientSecret, SubscriptionIds) MUST be
# supplied via `dotnet user-secrets` – never put them in any appsettings file.
#
# Rule order matters: wildcard first, then explicit negations (git is top-down).
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

# ── Azure Developer CLI (azd) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-environment state, including .env files that may hold non-secret outputs.
# Never commit – contains environment-specific values and is recreated by azd.
.azure/

# ── .NET build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
out/
publish/

# ── NuGet ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ── User-specific files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
.idea/
.vs/
*.rsuser

# ── dotnet user-secrets store (kept in %APPDATA% normally, but just in case) ──
**/secrets.json

# ── Rider / JetBrains ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.sln.iml
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# ── VS Code ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# ── Visual Studio ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.ncb
*.opendb
*.sdf
ipch/
*.cachefile
*.aps
*.sbr

# ── OS generated files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
LogFiles/

# ── Blazor / Razor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated source files produced during build – not needed in source control
*.g.cs
*.g.i.cs

# ── Test results ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*/

# ── Docker (if added later) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
